## Driving Score Algorithm

| Component | Weight | Scoring Logic |
|-----------|--------|---------------|
| Speed Compliance | 30% | (1 - violations/total_readings) × 100 |
| Braking Smoothness | 25% | 0 events=100, ≤2=80, ≤5=60, >5=30 |
| Acceleration Patterns | 20% | 0 events=100, ≤3=75, >3=40 |
| Trip Duration | 15% | ≤90min=100, ≤120=80, ≤150=50, >150=20 |
| Fuel Efficiency | 10% | ≤6L/100km=100, ≤8=80, ≤10=60, >10=40 |

## OBD-II PIDs Used

| PID | Description | Formula | Unit |
|-----|-------------|---------|------|
| 0x0D | Vehicle Speed | A | km/h |
| 0x0C | Engine RPM | ((A×256)+B)/4 | rpm |
| 0x05 | Coolant Temp | A - 40 | °C |
| 0x11 | Throttle Position | (A×100)/255 | % |

## Alert Severity Levels

| Level | Trigger | Action |
|-------|---------|--------|
| INFO | 90min driving, speed +10 over limit | Notification |
| WARNING | 120min driving, speed +20, harsh braking | Notification + Vibration |
| CRITICAL | 150min driving, speed +30 over limit | Notification + Long Vibration + Sound |
